Error [E0609]: `SqliteDB` is private in module `core.db`
  --> core_db_handle_import_is_private.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | use core.db.[SqliteDB]
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A Core module's API is the names it exports; its other types and helpers belong to Core alone
 Fix: Use what `core.db` exports instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0609
